    "detailed_description": "<h1>Changes Coming Soon</h1><p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Addition of a story line.</li><li>DLC:Jungles of Shinoah</li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Explore the Lands of Shinoah in this 2D rpg game inspired by the jrpg classics. <br><br>Troubles stir in the Lands of Shinoah.<br><br>Monsters have recently come out of their lairs<br>to decimate the populous. Travel around the lands <br>and discover the source of the threats.<br><br>Control four characters as they travel the lands of Shinoah with sword<br>and magic and defeat the evil that is present. You will travel to different<br>sites from ruins, caves, and floating castles to be successful in your quest.<br><br>Take control of four heroes in random battles, with turn-based combat. Fight<br>from a first-person perspective against the denizens of Shinoah as you explore <br>the ruins, castles, and caves of the land.",
